{"post":{"id":"e8ae6d1a-58cb-48e7-9686-6a3e18ea6d03","title":"4月26日（日）花園通りに出ます！ワンコイン婚活カウンセリング、予約なしで気軽にどうぞ。","excerpt":"4月26日（日）、花園通りで開催される花園市に出店します。夫婦関係のこと、片思いのこと、マッチングアプリで婚活しているけどうまくいかないこと、他の結婚相談所に入会中だけどちょっと相談したいこと——何でも大丈夫です。\nテント名：ワンコインカウンセリング\n\n\n\n料金：500円 / 20分\n\n\n\n予約：不要です。当日テントにそのまま来てください。\n","firstPublishedDate":"2026-04-24T11:50:20.370Z","lastPublishedDate":"2026-04-24T13:42:54.294Z","slug":"4月26日（日）花園通りに出ます！ワンコイン婚活カウンセリング、予約なしで気軽にどうぞ。","featured":false,"pinned":false,"categoryIds":["fc247847-d52b-438c-ab23-95bae771dc0a"],"memberId":"69e25236-d316-4da8-92e4-f500aca1fe37","hashtags":[],"commentingEnabled":true,"minutesToRead":2,"tagIds":["a8fd177f-b3ba-4a57-9f81-c26ba1ec0488","4e0145e6-4a1a-4f18-aee3-859a6eb18b17"],"relatedPostIds":["59111839-05a2-4b2a-afeb-87acd564b09f","1418a8d9-ed79-4a1e-85fd-4c3fc644eae6","3f84d312-9c4f-40b7-8476-963876091b38"],"pricingPlanIds":[],"language":"ja","seoData":{"tags":[{"type":"title","children":"4月26日（日）花園通りに出ます！ワンコイン婚活カウンセリング、予約なしで気軽にどうぞ。","custom":false,"disabled":false},{"type":"meta","props":{"name":"description","content":"4月26日（日）10時〜15時、松山市・花園通りに出店します！500円・20分のワンコインカウンセリング。婚活・夫婦関係・片思い・アプリ婚活など何でもOK。予約不要です。"},"children":"","custom":false,"disabled":false}],"settings":{"preventAutoRedirect":false,"keywords":[{"term":"松山市　花園市　ワンコイン　カウンセリング","isMain":true}]}},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"67bca2e1-1bc5-418f-ac9d-4b68bf144d40","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"こんにちは！松山市駅から徒歩3分。あすなる愛媛の結婚相談所、プロの心理カウンセラーで仲人の中嶋美知です\uD83D\uDE0A","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ba91128b-5995-4804-baea-470558deb73c","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"毎週水曜9時に女性向け、木曜9時に男性向け、日曜9時に男女皆様へのメッセージをお届けしています。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"aab7292b-956c-44ed-9586-d6ea45f1aad6","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"605da641-f906-4310-89ee-20ae2d4e1b18","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"今日は、告知のお知らせです！","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6baff874-9e93-4ad2-bcc3-cfc0283a4fb9","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6d8fd5de-1eba-4f8a-9031-a7b0409dacd3","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"4月26日（日）、花園通りで開催される花園市に出店します。","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fb7fb813-a9c3-4a8c-b394-7f64e9c9f83c","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"95a6d575-32bb-4748-881a-d1b388e3d709","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"花園通りと言えば、伊予鉄道・松山市駅の目の前から城山公園まで続く、松山の人たちに親しまれているあのストリート。その日は各テントが並ぶ花園日曜市が開催されます。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"318cf744-a3fe-4a71-b55d-3151b547eb46","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3e45d53b-6db1-44f1-a3db-521177334512","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"あすなる愛媛は、「ワンコインカウンセリング」のテントを出します。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"s896l9176","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"casq79029","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"SMALL"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"a4e52d_554b3a9e2244462bbf73c13efacc4976~mv2.png"},"width":1254,"height":1254}}},{"type":"DIVIDER","id":"32cf007e-5f46-429e-9340-2274018c8c72","nodes":[],"dividerData":{"lineStyle":"SINGLE","width":"LARGE","alignment":"CENTER"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2834aa59-9366-479d-add1-3d41c3dda0d3","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"49caf14b-1cfb-40c3-bb5b-4b714500e7cc","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"こんな方に来てほしいなぁ","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"p5pxs3575","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"34bba0f1-fc9b-4e4a-8823-fadf954d6739","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"「婚活ってどこから始めればいいの？」と思っている方。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"feb029d9-ee80-4e48-bd8a-a67046c47c50","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2f43bfbf-0064-4657-8a6f-425755a7b96a","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"「結婚相談所って、自分に合うのかな…」と気になっていた方。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4ece051f-955e-4644-a389-750c6e3f8c6b","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6d351714-0505-477f-8541-dfe8cdceeaf4","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"「誰かにちょっと話を聞いてもらいたいけど、がっつり相談は怖い」という方。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"731d87c8-c720-4425-af3e-0129665a04dd","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5681bb94-9b7c-4510-809f-7d7f27c70fa7","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"でもね、それだけじゃないんです。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f38449b9-20a3-4f23-8bd5-81ad29bc26f2","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3e9899b2-478b-4943-856a-dfe0bc44d62e","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"夫婦関係のこと、片思いのこと、マッチングアプリで婚活しているけどうまくいかないこと、他の結婚相談所に入会中だけどちょっと相談したいこと——何でも大丈夫です。","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"67ed2f3a-0e32-4cbd-af04-b34a96db093c","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fb55b489-4d4e-4086-9a0a-ed05e9cbaede","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"私はプロの心理カウンセラーでもあるので、婚活に限らず、恋愛や人間関係のお悩みならなんでも一緒に考えます。「これ相談していいのかな」と迷っているものほど、持ってきてください（笑）。","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"3215c035-95bb-4fe7-ba4c-82cef252daa1","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"DIVIDER","id":"5fc19854-dd3f-4a5e-adf9-9f6d4c8065e1","nodes":[],"dividerData":{"lineStyle":"SINGLE","width":"LARGE","alignment":"CENTER"}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"c0a40a4